      "seed": 8605252,
      "version": 255,
      "versionNonce": 1546151364,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784209983575,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Youtube Top K\nGives the top k most watched videos sorted by views on a give range(day, month, hour)\n\nThere are a lot of variants of this problem and interviewers and take any path to test you.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Youtube Top K\nGives the top k most watched videos sorted by views on a give range(day, month, hour)\n\nThere are a lot of variants of this problem and interviewers and take any path to test you.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lHsg6RUmBLGn1Ueg5kLUB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -49306.24892764298,
      "y": -5602.2339971984375,
      "width": 842.2994384765625,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 928598524,
      "version": 774,
      "versionNonce": 1564608068,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784210655448,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- query top k videos for all-time with max of 1000 results\n- query tumbling windows of 1 {hour, day , month} and all-time\n\n-------- Below the line --------\n- Arbitrary time periods\n- Arbitrary start/end ponints\n\n\nTwo types of windows in streaming:\n\n1. Tumbling Window : If current time is 10:06 the last hour window will be 9:00 - 10:00\n2. Sliding Window : It current time is 10:06, the last hour window will be 9:06 - 10:06\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- query top k videos for all-time with max of 1000 results\n- query tumbling windows of 1 {hour, day , month} and all-time\n\n-------- Below the line --------\n- Arbitrary time periods\n- Arbitrary start/end ponints\n\n\nTwo types of windows in streaming:\n\n1. Tumbling Window : If current time is 10:06 the last hour window will be 9:00 - 10:00\n2. Sliding Window : It current time is 10:06, the last hour window will be 9:06 - 10:06\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Gfk35b8Ii2iaEeQ6_0js",
