      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784273117928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Great Solution : Flink\n- CMS and sorted list can be maintained in Flink's state management in memory(use checkpoint in Flink to loose state)\n- More resilient to failures than Redis approach\n\n\n- Both approach fall short for sliding windows as we need to remove old and add new views\n- But CMS provides a solution by offering to remove items from the sketch but this is useful when we guarantee we're only decrementing items we've previously incremented",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Great Solution : Flink\n- CMS and sorted list can be maintained in Flink's state management in memory(use checkpoint in Flink to loose state)\n- More resilient to failures than Redis approach\n\n\n- Both approach fall short for sliding windows as we need to remove old and add new views\n- But CMS provides a solution by offering to remove items from the sketch but this is useful when we guarantee we're only decrementing items we've previously incremented",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
